SEC-03.worked_example_ar:
دورة تبديل وتدوير الـ Refresh Token (RTR) في طبقة الشبكة:
```kotlin
class TokenAuthenticator(private val sessionManager: SecureSessionManager) : Authenticator {
    override fun authenticate(route: Route?, response: Response): Request? {
        val newTokens = refreshSession(sessionManager.getRefreshToken())
        sessionManager.saveTokens(newTokens.access, newTokens.refresh)
        return response.request.newBuilder()
            .header("Authorization", "Bearer ${newTokens.access}").build()
    }
}
```

